<%# One /websites portfolio card (Alex McRitchie, 2026-11-06): the app's dark-mode
    still fills the whole card, a shade of the app's own dark panel rises over its
    lower part, and the name, the host and a two-line blurb sit on the shade.
    /build keeps its own card (build/_gallery_card); this one is /websites only.

    The text block is filled with the shade (--pc-shade, the palette's panel at
    BuildGallery::PORTFOLIO_SHADE_ALPHA) and a gradient fades it in above the
    text, so the still shows through at the top. The still under the text is
    never known, so the name and text are measured against the shade laid over
    pure white, the worst case (test/models/build_gallery_test.rb, and in the
    browser e2e/websites_portfolio.spec.js). The colours ride in as custom
    properties (WebsitesHelper#portfolio_card_style): the app's palette, #rrggbb
    only, or the Studio shade. The card looks the same in both hub themes: it is
    a picture of a dark app.

    The motion loop plays over the still on mouse hover or keyboard focus, as on
    /build (app/javascript/gallery_motion.js, the same data hooks). %>
<% host = (URI.parse(example.url).host rescue nil) || example.url %>
<%= link_to example.url, target: "_blank", rel: "noopener",
      class: "portfolio-card group relative block aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-surface-alt focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary",
      style: portfolio_card_style(example),
      data: { test: "build-example", portfolio_card: true, gallery_motion: (true if example.motion) } do %>
  <% if example.image %>
    <%= image_tag example.image, alt: "#{example.name}, as it looks live", loading: "lazy",
          class: "absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-left-top transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.03] motion-reduce:transition-none motion-reduce:group-hover:scale-100",
          data: { test: "build-example-image" } %>
    <% if example.motion %>
      <video src="<%= asset_path(example.motion) %>"
             muted loop playsinline preload="none" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"
             class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-left-top opacity-0 data-[playing]:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 motion-reduce:hidden"
             data-gallery-motion-video data-test="build-example-motion"></video>
    <% end %>
  <% else %>
    <span class="absolute inset-0 flex items-start justify-center pt-10 text-6xl" aria-hidden="true"><%= example.emoji %></span>
  <% end %>
  <span class="portfolio-card-body absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 block px-4 pb-3 pt-0.5 text-left" data-test="portfolio-card-body">
    <span class="portfolio-card-name block text-base font-bold leading-6 truncate" data-test="build-example-name"><%= example.name %></span>
    <span class="portfolio-card-text block font-mono text-xs leading-5 truncate" data-test="build-example-host"><%= host %></span>
    <span class="portfolio-card-text mt-1 text-xs leading-4 line-clamp-2" title="<%= example.blurb %>"
          data-test="build-example-blurb"><%= example.blurb %></span>
  </span>
<% end %>
